  "content": [
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:30 AM",
      "text": "[Attachment: Image]"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:31 AM",
      "text": "There’s a lot going on in that image. My favorite is that, even if you were going, he thinks he’d see you at 9."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:31 AM",
      "text": "Emphasized “There’s a lot going on in that image. My favorite is that, even if you were going, he thinks he’d see you at 9.”"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:31 AM",
      "text": "Oooh, that was a good one"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:32 AM",
      "text": "Made me say \"ooh\" out loud"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:39 AM",
      "text": "[Attachment: Image]"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:39 AM",
      "text": "\"Hey!\""
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:43 AM",
      "text": "“Make sure you ask V-Mart if he’s going to retire anytime soon.”"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:46 AM",
      "text": "I was real excited earlier when the Rangers scored in the ninth to take Hamels off the hook for the L. But now Trout is going to bat with another chance for the cycle. Cycles are 15 points in our league"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:46 AM",
      "text": "Just wanted to say that"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:47 AM",
      "text": "(I'm playing against Trout.)"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:47 AM",
      "text": "What does he need for the cycle?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:47 AM",
      "text": "Double"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:49 AM",
      "text": "He flew out. Goodnight, Greg"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:49 AM",
      "text": "Great seeing you"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:50 AM",
      "text": "Always a pleasure, Anthony."
    }
  ]
}